# --- Manuscript / research material (policy change 2026-05-22) ---
# This GitHub repo is kept focused on the open-source Python package (code,
# tests, CI, packaging). The manuscript + research material (protocol,
# proposals, sections, figures, run logs, experimental result artifacts) is
# being separated into a sibling repo "REAP-research". These paths are
# ignored here going forward; already-tracked files under them will be
# removed from this repo (git rm) when the REAP-research split happens.
# Standard package docs (README, CHANGELOG, CONTRIBUTING, CODE_OF_CONDUCT,
# LICENSE) and the package's own docs/ stay tracked.
manuscript/
docs/verification/
results/
